       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLSUB.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TIMES-CALLED PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 L-COUNT PIC 9(3).
       01 L-REC.
          05 L-NAME PIC X(6).
          05 L-AMT  PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3.
       01 L-ALT REDEFINES L-REC PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-COUNT L-REC.
           ADD 1 TO TIMES-CALLED.
           ADD 10 TO L-COUNT.
           MOVE "BETA" TO L-NAME.
           ADD TIMES-CALLED TO L-AMT.
           DISPLAY "SUB " TIMES-CALLED " " L-COUNT " " L-ALT(1:6).
           EXIT PROGRAM.
           DISPLAY "NEVER".
